{
  "name": "06 - Scheduling & Orchestration / Reconcile Transfers",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "node-0030",
      "name": "Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        -160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Reconcile Transfers\n\nSingle Responsibility: trigger GET /api/cron/reconcile-transfers on a schedule and route the outcome to Logger (success) or System Error (failure). All matching logic lives in reconcileTransfers() (src/imports/reconciliation/) — this workflow owns scheduling only.\n\nEvery SMS/email transaction posts immediately as its own EXPENSE/INCOME row (see import.service.ts). This job is Phase 2: it scans recent UNMATCHED transactions and merges exact-amount, different-account pairs into one canonical TRANSFER row. An unmatched leg past the 45-minute match window is left exactly as posted — expected steady-state, not a failure. Runs every 15 minutes so nothing waits longer than that for a same-account match to resolve.\n\nUses CRON_SECRET (already defined server-side, same secret every other cron route in this app uses).",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-0031",
      "name": "Schedule",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        240,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "*/15 * * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-0032",
      "name": "Reconcile Transfers",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        520,
        320
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 2000,
      "continueOnFail": true,
      "alwaysOutputData": true,
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $env.BUDGETFLOW_BASE_URL + '/api/cron/reconcile-transfers' }}",
        "authentication": "none",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "={{ 'Bearer ' + $env.CRON_SECRET }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendQuery": false,
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true,
              "responseFormat": "json",
              "fullResponse": true
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-0033",
      "name": "Success?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        800,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "node-0034",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.statusCode < 400 }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-0035",
      "name": "Log Success",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1080,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "source": "database",
        "workflowId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "SELECT_AFTER_IMPORT:05 - Utilities / Logger",
          "cachedResultName": "05 - Utilities / Logger"
        },
        "workflowInputs": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "value": {}
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "After importing, point this at the \"05 - Utilities / Logger\" workflow (n8n assigns IDs on import)."
    },
    {
      "id": "node-0036",
      "name": "Notify: System Error",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1080,
        440
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "source": "database",
        "workflowId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "SELECT_AFTER_IMPORT:04 - Notifications / System Error",
          "cachedResultName": "04 - Notifications / System Error"
        },
        "workflowInputs": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "value": {}
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "After importing, point this at the \"04 - Notifications / System Error\" workflow (n8n assigns IDs on import)."
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Schedule": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
